      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i've hit it. there's no more music left in me. everything i write now just feels like a cheap imitation of the stuff i did three years ago. it’s like i can see the ceiling and i'm just staring at it. i don't want to keep going just to watch myself become a parody of who i used to be.",
